{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026RDpgD8TWVG1793266101.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>韓國指朝鮮向東部海域，發射10多枚短程彈道導彈，是時隔17天再次試射。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.NK.MISSILE 1600_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026lUGMiz3yyn1793266119.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>韓聯社報道，韓國聯合參謀本部表示，偵測到朝鮮周四中午，從江原道元山向東部海域，發射約10枚短程彈道導彈，韓國國家安保室與相關部門開會後，敦促朝鮮立即停止挑釁行為。</p><p></p><p>韓國軍方表示已加強監視警戒，並與美國、日本共享最新情況。日本防衛省就指，有關疑似彈道導彈，落入日本專屬經濟區外。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.NK.MISSILE 1600_003.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026455k3kdVhK1793266109.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>朝鮮本月12日曾試射多枚彈道導彈，部分飛行距離達到九百公里以上。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T10:42:14.433831+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":207,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T08:23:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T02:18:11.635078+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T10:38:27.768210+00:00","content_hash":"c649ed21919f0b3958d825b342ef62da7b366f70267b9ec35e68a09407f5649a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-29T10:42:14.433831+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}